--- !u!114 &704697841
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 704697839}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1b3851dae072093498e3f8f589d2980f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::JbelIghoud.Game.JbelIntroCutscene
  player: {fileID: 341079040}
  elder: {fileID: 1671225995}
  elderBody: {fileID: 5347231527350235452}
  elderPose: {fileID: 5347231527350235453}
  introStart: {fileID: 418704254}
  introStop: {fileID: 460145680}
  talkDistance: 2.1
  cutsceneCamera: {fileID: 1840742663}
  activePriority: 100
  handBackBlend: 1.6
  ui: {fileID: 309017228}
  hudPanel: {fileID: 761598798}
  joystickZone: {fileID: 1675535847}
  objectives: {fileID: 704697842}
  walkSpeed: 3.2
  walkAnimSpeed: 0.62
  spawnAngleFromElder: 100
  titleLine: JBEL IGHOUD
  subtitleLine: "MOROCCO  \xB7  300,000 YEARS AGO"
  elderName: THE ELDER
  askPlayerName: 0
  worldLines:
  - Ah... you are awake. Good. The mountain did not take you.
  - This is Jbel Ighoud. Here, nothing is given. The land feeds only those who understand
    it.
  - The nights are cold, and the beasts are stronger than us. Bare hands are not
    enough.
  - But stone... stone can become a tooth, a claw, even fire. If you learn to listen
    to it.
  - Come. Walk with me, and I will show you.
  linesBeforeName:
  - Ah... a new face among the stones of Jbel Ighoud.
  - These hills remember the first of our kind. Long before memory, they walked where
    you stand.
  - You look lost, child. Lost... but not without purpose.
  nameQuestion: Tell me... what is your name?
  linesAfterName:
  - '{name}... a strong name. The mountain will remember it.'
  - Every journey begins with the ground beneath your feet. The old ones shaped stone
    into tools, and so must you.
  - Gather three stones from the hillside, then return to me.
--- !u!114 &704697842
