--- !u!114 &704697843
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 704697839}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6188c65ebb05ce44da5196d40b6a0abb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::JbelIghoud.Game.JbelElderGuide
  player: {fileID: 341079040}
  elderRoot: {fileID: 1671225995}
  elderAnimator: {fileID: 0}
  elderPose: {fileID: 0}
  objectives: {fileID: 704697842}
  path:
  - {fileID: 120961188}
  - {fileID: 1916989361}
  - {fileID: 1392206554}
  - {fileID: 431478202}
  - {fileID: 593152785}
  - {fileID: 1726533177}
  - {fileID: 727456614}
  - {fileID: 1736156576}
  - {fileID: 1547904652}
  rockSpots:
  - {fileID: 1638250957}
  - {fileID: 1117725576}
  - {fileID: 2134639161}
  - {fileID: 799128310}
  - {fileID: 193270676}
  - {fileID: 1377689721}
  - {fileID: 764389466}
  - {fileID: 708958271}
  rockSpotJitter: 2.5
  rockTemplate: {fileID: 1251356120}
  stoneTypes:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8c8a56f2469bcda4d963ac7eab065599, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3b12541acfd064f42b53ff2f95d13feb, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: a060b97b28a66304e8911af5197b6575, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f41b3c94d0e4179bc353ea8f203112, type: 2}
  shineMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: fafcef78ce5b2144ba659232ba32fb7e, type: 2}
  shineRadius: 50
  stoneSize: 0.55
  elderWalkSpeed: 2.6
  elderAnimSpeed: 0.62
  playerSpeedNearElder: 3
  paceRadius: 9
  waitDistance: 50
  resumeDistance: 8
  firstStoneTalkRadius: 4
  speaker: THE ELDER
  followLine: Follow me. Stay close.
  walkLines:
  - Our people have lived on this mountain for longer than anyone can count.
  - Down there, the river. Water, fish... and the beasts that come to drink.
  - The sun warms the stone by day. By night, only fire keeps the cold away.
  - Watch the ground as we walk. The mountain hides its gifts among the pebbles.
  waitLines:
  - Do not wander off, child. Come back to me.
  - This way. I am waiting.
  firstStoneLines:
  - There. Do you see it? That gleam on the ground.
  - The things you need will often catch the light like this. When something shines,
    go to it.
  - Not every stone is the same. Some are soft, some are hard, and one of them can
    cut.
  - Gather the shining stones. Each kind, one by one.
  collectWalkLines:
  - Good. Keep your eyes on the ground.
  - Feel their weight in your hand. Each one is different.
  bagLines:
  - Good. You found them all.
  - Everything you collect goes into your bag. Open it, and look at what you carry.
  hammerstoneData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 998033200611f5c4cbab32d93f296f87, type: 2}
  giveLinesBefore:
  - You have found them all. But a stone keeps its secrets... until you strike it.
  - Take this. A quartzite cobble from the river. Harder than anything on this mountain.
  giveLinesAfter:
  - It will not break. Keep it with you, always. With it, you can open any stone.
  cavePath:
  - {fileID: 2020182973}
  - {fileID: 863421662}
  - {fileID: 1087388105}
  - {fileID: 572615197}
  - {fileID: 196611475}
  - {fileID: 1896892608}
  - {fileID: 1295377621}
  caveIntroLines:
  - You strike well. Your hands already remember what your head forgets.
  - The sun is going down. Nights on this mountain are cold, and the beasts come
    out.
  - Up there is my cave. It is where we sleep, where we keep the fire alive... and
    where the old ones left their marks on the walls.
  - Come. Follow me.
  caveWalkLines:
  - Stay close. The path climbs here.
  - From the cave you can see the whole valley. Nothing comes up without us knowing.
  - My father lived in this cave, and his father before him.
  caveArriveLines:
  - Here it is. My home.
  - Rest your legs. Tonight, I will show you what lives inside.
  torchMesh: {fileID: 8762530889937237612, guid: fe24643ce928c8446b376982c74e7192, type: 3}
  torchMaterial: {fileID: -2583828004807172877, guid: fe24643ce928c8446b376982c74e7192, type: 3}
  torchPickup: {fileID: 1063278245}
  torchStandSpot: {fileID: 1717716958}
  torchMount: {fileID: 1678482924}
  unlitTorchAtMount: {fileID: 1450646836}
  torchGoLine: It is dark inside. Let me bring the light.
  torchDoneLine: There. Now the cave is awake. Come inside.
  strikeGoal: 3
  hintLines:
  - Look around. Some stones are still shining.
  - You are missing a stone. Follow the gleam.
